</section>
<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Ablation Study</h3>

<div id="S5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To elucidate the contribution of each component within our <span id="S5.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">TranX-Adapter</span>, we perform ablation studies on GenImage using LLaVA-1.6-mistral 7B. As presented in Table <a href="#S5.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 5.3 Ablation Study ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ TranX-Adapter: Bridging Artifacts and Semantics within MLLMs for RobustAI-generated Image Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, incorporating the artifact encoder to provide auxiliary forgery cues yields a 4.6% improvement in accuracy. Introducing <span id="S5.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">X-Fusion</span> and <span id="S5.SS3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">TOP-Fusion</span> individually brings further gains of 2.3% and 3.2%, respectively. When both fusion strategies are jointly applied, the model attains an accuracy of 91.9%, confirming that the two fusion mechanisms complement each other and jointly enhance detection performance.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T4.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="S5.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Ablation study of different module in <span id="S5.T4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">TranX-Adapter</span><span id="S5.T4.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. The first row shows the results of LLaVA-1.6-mistral 7B. We integrate NPR, apply <span id="S5.T4.7.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">X-Fusion</span> and <span id="S5.T4.7.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">TOP-Fusion</span> separately, and then use the full bidirectional fusion strategy.</span></span></figcaption>
<div id="S5.T4.8" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:96.9pt;vertical-align:-45.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(41.5pt,-11.6pt) scale(1.3163731549751,1.3163731549751) ;">
<table id="S5.T4.8.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T4.8.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
